{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/MapError"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/MapError\/timeout(_:customError:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Fails if the sequence goes the given duration without producing an element, measured on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SuspendingClock"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"timeout"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"duration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Duration"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"customError"},{"kind":"text","text":": (any "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Error"},{"kind":"text","text":")? = nil) -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncSequences"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Timeout","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Timeout"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency15SuspendingClockV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SuspendingClock"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"duration","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The longest the